WEBVTT

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:30.204
bright in the noontime sun,

00:01:30.246 --> 00:01:33.038
when from behind there was a great bang,

00:01:33.079 --> 00:01:35.288
as loud and violent as a bomb.

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:38.038
My head snapped back over my red seat,

00:01:38.038 --> 00:01:41.038
my eardrum blew, my shoes flew off.

00:01:41.579 --> 00:01:44.663
I flew too, my head bobbing
on broken bones,

00:01:44.663 --> 00:01:47.871
and when I landed, I was a quadriplegic.

00:01:48.913 --> 00:01:51.538
Over the coming months,
I learned to breathe on my own,

00:01:51.538 --> 00:01:53.746
then to sit and to stand and to walk.

00:01:54.204 --> 00:01:56.663
But my body was now divided vertically.

00:01:56.704 --> 00:01:58.746
I was a hemiplegic,

00:01:58.788 --> 00:02:00.204
and back home in New York,